WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:24.000
Hidden Power
Mystery of the God Cards

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:29.500
Attention, duelists.

00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:33.400
We will have a 20-minute break.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.780
Gather at the bingo machine in the hall in 20 minutes.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:41.510
We will pick the competitors for the second duel.

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.800
We have 20 minutes.

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:45.880
Let's hurry.

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:51.390
What are you doing here?

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:53.000
Mokuba.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:54.480
Where is Kaiba's room?

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:57.660
Right here.  But what do you want with my brother?

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:00.120
Kaiba!  I know you're in there!

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.260
Open the door!

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:02.840
What are you doing?

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:04.420
Don't disturb him!

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.000
- Stop it, Jonouchi!

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:07.000
- Kaiba!  Open up!

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.680
I knew it was you, lame-o.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:17.240
You don't know how important the time before a battle is for a duelist.

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:19.680
What?

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.280
Jonouchi, this isn't the time to fight!

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:25.680
Kaiba!

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:26.460
Yugi.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:28.960
Kaiba, I need a favor.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.400
Land the Battle Ship?

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.210
Bakura is still unconscious.

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:42.370
We stopped his bleeding for now.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:45.910
He left the hospital when he shouldn't.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:48.570
That's not my problem.

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:52.800
We need to land and take him to a hospital.

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:57.200
Shizuka is...

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:57.930
...right!

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:02.710
No matter his condition, it's his responsibility when he decided to duel.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:07.700
Please!  A life is more important than a duel!

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.570
Yeah!

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.220
Well said, Shizuka!

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:20.470
Kaiba, don't you have any compassion?

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.620
I can't land the ship.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.460
What?

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.510
Wait, Kaiba!

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.550
Jonouchi!

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.420
Send the medic to Room 6.

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:39.760
The Battle Ship has better doctors and equipment than the city.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.760
He'll be fine.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.770
Shizuka!  You were great back there!

00:03:50.770 --> 00:03:57.280
Kaiba was touched when you said that a life is more important than a duel.

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.780
I was touched too.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:01.790
It was nothing.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:06.580
I guess we'll let Kaiba's medical team take care of Bakura.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.790
Yeah.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:11.540
I'll search for Bakura's Millennium Ring.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.800
Let's all split up and search.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:18.080
No.  You two should focus on dueling.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:22.310
Duelists have to prepare.

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:24.310
But Honda...

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:26.130
Don't worry.

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:29.330
We can do more than cheer for you.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:31.320
Let us be useful.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:34.200
Shizuka, let's search together.

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:37.320
Otogi, let's go together.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:39.170
But I-

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:41.820
The Millennium Ring appears randomly.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:45.850
It's hard to find on my own, so you have to help me.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:51.050
He's nice sometimes.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:54.570
Yeah, but wasn't Honda acting weird?

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.090
I don't think it's here.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.090
Should we go somewhere else?

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:15.360
There's one thing I want to make clear.

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:20.840
I've been thinking about this since we met again in Domino City.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:21.820
About what?

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.600
You're too touchy-feely with Shizuka.

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:29.940
That's what you wanted to say?

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:33.370
Honda, what's your relationship with Shizuka?

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:34.610
Are you her boyfriend?

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.350
Well, no...

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:40.880
I'd understand if Jonouchi said that because he's her brother.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:43.350
But you're in no position to say that to me.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.090
Say what!

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:49.300
How I feel about Shizuka is none of your business.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:55.480
Instead of bringing me here, why don't you just tell Shizuka that you like her?

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:01.570
But I know who's going to win.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.710
How dare you!

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.210
Want to fight?

00:06:05.430 --> 00:06:07.000
Yeah!  Let's fight!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.310
Damn!  Otogi!

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.040
Are you trying to kill me?

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.640
Sorry!  Hang on tight!

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.540
Is anyone there?

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.040
Help!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:44.760
Help us!

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:50.140
Dammit!  No one's out here this late.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:53.060
Honda...

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.790
Damn.  My hand is becoming numb.

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.030
Stay strong, Honda!

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:04.320
Damn!

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.440
Honda!

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:08.540
I can't hold on...

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.220
Thanks.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.960
I'm safe...

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:33.300
Thanks for saving our lives.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:34.820
What's your name-

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.250
What's wrong, Honda?

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:43.420
The guy in white who saved us...  He's gone.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.570
The guy in white?

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:09.530
You're Shadi!

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:17.480
Your challenge at Duelist Kingdom, the mystery sealed in the Millennium Puzzle for 3000 years...

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:21.540
You discovered the identity of your other self.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:26.550
Yes.  My other self is the soul of the Pharaoh.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:30.550
Correct.  You are the host for the Pharaoh's soul.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:32.400
How did you get here?

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:36.560
Well, you always appear mysteriously.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:40.960
I watch over the Millennium Items.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:45.070
All seven Items have gathered on this ship.

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:49.810
And the three God Cards.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:56.980
Everything needed to open the door to the Pharaoh's memories are on the Battle Ship.

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.480
Really?

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:04.000
But listen carefully, host for the Pharaoh's soul.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:09.990
Only the chosen ones can use the Millennium Items and the God Cards.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:16.000
If a non-chosen tries to use them, he will earn God's wrath.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.000
God's wrath?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:24.940
Yes.  When Pegasus went to Egypt to revive his lost love...

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:40.420
He saw many tablets engraved with monsters.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:46.500
Fascinated with the tablets, Pegasus returned to Egypt many times.

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:53.000
He wanted to learn the secrets of the tablets, for the Pharaoh and his priests used them to rule the land.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.880
That started everything.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:01.010
How the game known as Duel Monsters returned in the present day.

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.510
Duel Monsters?

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:24.300
That started everything.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:28.810
How the game known as Duel Monsters returned in the present day.

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:30.810
Duel Monsters?

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:38.200
While researching the tablets, Pegasus learned about the existence of the three God Cards.

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:42.090
And he tried to revive the God Cards.

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:45.400
Why can't you find the God Cards?

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:49.220
The God Cards are real!

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:59.130
Why aren't they here?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:03.120
My Duel Monsters won't be complete without the God Cards!

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:09.490
You're Shadi.

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:16.260
The gravekeepers are using their dark powers to seal the three God Card tablets.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:18.550
You will never find them.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.320
Oh my god!

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:24.560
But I have the power to show them to you.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.200
Really?  Please!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.040
Please show me!

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.140
An underground city?

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:58.190
Come.

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:13.770
No!  Someone's here!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.160
What's going on?

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:33.510
They can't see us.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.950
Oh!  Unbelievable!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.240
We're here.

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:50.960
The door of history is about to open.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:57.460
The three God Cards will break its 3000 years of silence and awaken.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.800
Oh!  This is...

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:58.710
Jesus!  I finally found the three legendary God Cards!

00:13:59.120 --> 00:14:00.560
Oh!  Great!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.720
I can now complete Duel Monsters!

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:17.280
With photos of the tablets in hand, Pegasus returned to America to design the cards.

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:20.640
I believed this may lead to terrible events.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:29.280
But if it would allow me find the owners of the Millennium Items, I accepted the consequences.

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:39.150
What?  Those involved with the God Cards are dying mysteriously?

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.150
Yes, sir...

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:22.600
Jesus!  I finally found the three legendary God Cards!

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:24.060
Oh!  Great!

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.720
I can now complete Duel Monsters-

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:33.840
These symbols are unique, even among ancient Egyptian hieroglyphs.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:37.800
Unless we decipher these symbols, we can never create the cards.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.550
What's going on?

00:15:56.110 --> 00:16:00.910
Some have accidents, others lose their minds in fear.

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.080
This isn't coincidence.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:05.370
Please stop recreating the God Cards.

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:13.410
The fate of my company depends on this big Duel Monsters project.

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:16.420
I will create a new history!

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:19.420
These few accidents aren't important!

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:22.150
Are you saying this is Gods' anger?

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:26.180
If so, I accept responsibility for their anger!

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:48.910
It seems the Gods' powers are no match for my dark powers.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:52.420
I'm a bit tired.

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:15.520
What's this?

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.260
Listen, Pegasus.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:29.130
Duel Monsters isn't just a game.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:33.260
It's a shadow game that has the power to destroy the world.

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:34.220
No!

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:38.510
Even if it's a shadow game...

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:45.170
...I'm willing to sell my soul to devil if I can release Duel Monsters!

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:53.180
You cannot control the power of the three cards.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.760
They should be sealed away in Egypt.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.680
No!

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:18.820
Unbelievable!

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:26.640
That overwhelming heat, power and pain was no illusion.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:34.590
Pegasus personally created the three God Cards.

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:41.020
But after experiencing their immense power, he decided to seal them away.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:50.600
I knew you would return them, Pegasus J. Crawford.

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:56.610
Pegasus visited that woman.

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:59.180
You mean Ishizu?

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:03.880
As the host of the Pharaoh's soul, please tell the Pharaoh-

00:19:08.010 --> 00:19:09.890
There's no need for that.

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:12.930
I'll listen to you myself, Shadi.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:16.560
Then I shall speak to you.

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:20.440
All seven Millennium Items are on this ship.

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:25.640
Please win your duels and open the door to your memories.

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:31.920
Tournament participants, please report to the hall.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:43.370
I'm counting on you, my other self.

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:47.190
Yeah.  I will collect the three cards.

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:58.080
It's true!  A guy wearing a white robe!

00:19:58.080 --> 00:20:00.040
I was shocked.  Right, Otogi?

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:03.640
I didn't actually see him...

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:06.500
Sheesh.  You're just trying to scare me.

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:08.200
I don't believe your story.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:11.320
But ghosts may really exist.

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:14.150
Not you too, Shizuka.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:16.670
What's going on?

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.650
Yugi!  Don't scare me!

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.060
Yugi, listen up...

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.070
Marik...

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:35.070
Here, sister.

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:41.050
Shadi.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:50.620
I see a horrible future for Marik.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:57.170
I will duel to prevent that future from happening.

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:47.300
Jonouchi's opponent in the second match is Marik!

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:52.070
He's the guy who brainwashed us and made us fight each other!

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:54.650
He can't be forgiven!

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:58.350
Jonouchi, pay him back in your duel!

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:02.920
Jonouchi is fired up, but Marik is eerily calm.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:06.500
What?  There's a giant temple on Marik's field?

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:09.970
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Jonouchi vs Trap Deck

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:11.500
Duel, standby!

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:21.960
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.960 --> 00:22:30.900
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:31.230 --> 00:22:35.870
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:39.840
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:47.820
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.820 --> 00:22:51.390
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:56.160
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:56.160 --> 00:23:06.270
And walk it without stopping

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:13.880
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:14.110 --> 00:23:22.850
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.850 --> 00:23:30.830
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:40.670
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
